# BuildKit reads THIS file (named after the Dockerfile it sits next to) instead
# of a root `.dockerignore`. Without it, stage 1 — which needs the whole
# workspace so `turbo prune` can see every `package.json` and compute the
# dependency graph — would also copy every app's `node_modules`, build cache
# and git history into the image. Mirrors `apps/worker-media/Dockerfile.dockerignore`.

**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
